# Runtime uploads (event photos, admin-added product shots) stay out of git —
# they belong to whichever machine they were uploaded on.
*

!.gitignore

# …except the seeded catalogue artwork, which the production SQL dump points
# at by path. Tracking it means a deploy is `git pull` + `storage:link`, with
# no separate archive to remember to copy across.
!products/
!products/**
!gift-addons/
!gift-addons/**
